{"ref":"BDB, רְעוּ","hw":"רְעוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְעוּ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>proposes name of a god, Duval <sup>ZA vi. 126</sup> Mez<sup>Ḥarrân 23</sup>, cf. Hom <sup>A. u. A ii. 208</sup><strong>)</strong>;—son of Peleg: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:18\" href=\"/Genesis.11.18\">Gn 11:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:19\" href=\"/Genesis.11.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:20\" href=\"/Genesis.11.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:21\" href=\"/Genesis.11.21\">21</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.25\">1 Ch 1:25</a>; Ραγαυ.","next":"BDB, רְעוּאֵל","prev":"BDB, רוּת²"}